{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KARIN\u2019S INSTRUCTION</h2>\u201cKarin's Instruction\u201d is a tank-themed parkour game where, through your efforts, you engage in various intimate interactions with coach Karin.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTER</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/4b51b304cd98062b1700b4dffb86740d.avif?t=1726650581\" width=228 height=400 /></span><br>Name\uff1aKarin Lorenz<br>Age\uff1a24<br><br>It may seem a bit aloof, but it has a gentle side. Due to professional reasons, it often gives off an impression of being difficult to approach. However, deep down, there is a desire for someone to rely on.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/3fe94075a3c04e3d7e0538956decbddb.poster.avif?t=1726650581\" width=598 height=186 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/3fe94075a3c04e3d7e0538956decbddb.webm?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/3fe94075a3c04e3d7e0538956decbddb.mp4?t=1726650581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Drive your tank on a straight road, with many vehicles blocking your way. Utilize your exceptional driving skills to maneuver around them, or turn the turret and blast a shot to eliminate them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/ada60f84c7c7d8252149dcab1855fb76.poster.avif?t=1726650581\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698230/extras/ada60f84c7c7d8252149dcab1855fb76.webm?t=1726650581\" type=\"